    {
      "id": "claim_31afda2e375c41929e21e462ffd6551f",
      "statement": "Both providers are constructed with langchain_openai.ChatOpenAI with the API key wrapped in pydantic.SecretStr; because both the LiteLLM server and OpenRouter expose OpenAI-compatible HTTP endpoints, the same ChatOpenAI client is reused for both providers, differing only in base_url, model, and api_key — there is no OpenAI-the-company dependency, only an OpenAI-protocol client pointed at two different proxies.",
