    {
      "id": "claim_b99c2644044441a8b992fddd299845a9",
      "statement": "build_prompt(question, correct_answer, user_answer) constructs a ChatPromptTemplate from a system message and a human message and returns the fully formatted prompt string; the system message instructs the model to act as a friendly, enthusiastic Brazilian-Portuguese quiz professor, give motivating feedback on wrong answers, explain the correct answer didactically, respond in natural spoken pt-BR with no markdown/bold/italic/special formatting, keep the response to a maximum of 500 characters, and politely refuse and redirect sexual/violent/offensive/inappropriate content without evaluating or commenting on it.",
