    {
      "id": "claim_d998ff923e944dda9dd283ac7488fa7e",
      "statement": "The provider chain is driven by environment variables read at import time in src/config.py: LITELLM_API_BASE_URL, LITELLM_API_KEY, LITELLM_MODEL, OPENROUTER_API_KEY, and OPENROUTER_FALLBACK_MODEL are required, while OPENROUTER_BASE_URL is optional with default https://openrouter.ai/api/v1; validate_config() (called from main() at app startup, not at import time) raises a ValueError listing any missing required variable, and SKIP_CONFIG_VALIDATION=1 short-circuits the check so tests can import src.* without real credentials.",
